:''Not to be confused with the [[Heavenly Tower]], [[Citadel]]s or [[Infernal Tower]].''
The '''Golden Tower''' (黄金にゃんこ塔, ''Ōgon Nyanko Tō'', '''Golden Cat Tower''') is an event added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]], first appearing during the [[Million Downloads Event/100 Million|100 Million Downloads Event]]. It has no known schedule, and all rewards reset on every appearance. The Cat Units unlocked from [[Golden Tower/Floor 30|Floor 30]], [[Golden Tower/Floor 40|Floor 40]], and [[Golden Tower/Floor 50|Floor 50]] are only obtainable once from the [[Catnip Challenges|Missions]] screen.

Compared to the original Heavenly Tower, the Golden Tower rewards are doubled, excluding the Tickets from Floors 15, 25, 30, 40 and 50, which are instead increased by 1. All stages are otherwise exactly the same as Heavenly Tower except Floor 50, which replaces the peons with enemies from [[GOLD RUSH#The Midas Touch|Golden Week]] and [[Silver Week]].
{{Map Stars|4095}}

==Overview==
The Golden Tower contains 50 stages, called '''Floors''' (階 ''Kai''), with a wide variety of enemies including [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s, [[:Category:Enemy Cats|Enemy Cats]], [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Bosses]] and even [[:Category:Event Enemies|event enemies]] from monthly and annual events. After completing a floor for the first time, the player will receive gifts including [[Battle Items]], [[Catseye]]s, [[Catfruit]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Gamatoto Expedition|Catamins]], XP, [[Ototo Corps|Materials]] and [[Leadership]]s along with [[Hermit Cat (Special Cat)|Hermit Cat]], [[Masked Yulala (Special Cat)|Masked Yulala]] and [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Master Uril]] upon defeating [[Hermit Cat (Enemy)|their]] [[Mystic Mask Yulala|respective]] [[Master Uril (Enemy)|counterparts]] on the 30th, 40th and 50th floors respectively, via the [[Catnip Challenges]] feature.

